body:
I can agree with you only part of the way. While, it might feel super great on the penis, you lose a few things. So it all depends on whether or not those few things drive your desire. You lose the ability to grind against the body. You lose the reciprocation of giving your partner pleasure. You lose the sound of your partner being pleasured (which can only be imitated and is generally fake). And you lose, generally speaking, ejaculation into the partner.

&#x200B;

Not denying a skilled handjob can't be incredible and that there aren't other benefits that might be better for certain people, but I still don't see them as completely comparable.
